Source: zen-browser
Section: web
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <quietcraft@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), chrpath, desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop

Package: zen-browser
Architecture: amd64
# Runtime set mapped from the RPM spec: dictionaries/hyphenation dirs,
# system CA certs module (libnssckbi is linked from the system libnss3
# instead of the bundled copy, like the spec). The bundled Firefox-private
# libs resolve via $ORIGIN and need no system providers.
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libhunspell, libhyphen0, libnss3
Description: Minimal browser focused on privacy and calm browsing
 Zen Browser is a free, open-source web browser based on Mozilla Firefox.
